                    title:                  `Change Canvas`,
                    subtitle:               `You are the Change Lead at a Dutch insurer rolling a new team-based way of working across 18 teams. Twelve weeks in, adoption is stuck at 34% against an 80% board target, resistance has climbed to 51/100, and €410K of the €1.2M budget is gone. Sequence interventions, set the communication cadence, and engage the right stakeholders first — before the platform licence renewal forces a go/no-go.`,
                    header_tag:             `14 April 2026 · Maasland Verzekeringen N.V. · Utrecht · the rollout has stalled`,
                    round_label:            `Round`,
                    period_of:              `of`,
                    decisions_heading:      `Your Decisions This Round`,
                    submit_btn:             `Commit the Plan`,
                    undo_btn:               `Undo Last Round`,
                    history_heading:        `Round-by-Round Record`,
                    chart_heading:          `Adoption, Resistance & Engagement Trajectory`,
                    chart_start:            `Stall`,
                    unit_mo:                `mo`,
                    coach_header:           `Facilitator (your COO sponsor & the steering committee)`,
                    coach_intro:            `Twelve weeks in and the dashboards are grim: 34% adoption against an 80% target, resistance up to 51, two teams reverted to spreadsheets, and €410K already spent — heavy on licences and a glossy launch, light on the things that actually embed. A respected operations manager has warned she’ll recommend reverting the whole division if she doesn’t see real adoption in two months. The platform licence renews in month 10. This is not a communication problem to shout louder at — it’s a change to design and monitor. Diagnose the real gap before you spend another euro.`,

